diff --git a/documentation/05_parameterfile.md b/documentation/05_parameterfile.md
index f68bfdc..cdf0187 100644
--- a/documentation/05_parameterfile.md
+++ b/documentation/05_parameterfile.md
@@ -1014,6 +1014,28 @@ object-by-object basis, if desired.
 
 -------
 
+**PFSeed**    654321
+
+An integer number that serves as seed for the random number generator
+used to generate the same projected field (in z axis). This will fix
+the seed for k_z modes.
+
+-------
+
+**ZeroModes**   0
+
+If set to 1, the modes except k_z=0 will be nulled. This will only 
+activate if `FIX_PROJECTED_FIELDS` is active. The seed used for
+the k_z=0 mode will be `PFSeed`. 
+
+-------
+
+**ZeroProjected**   0
+
+If set to 1, the k_z=0 modes will be nulled. This will only activate
+if `FIX_PROJECTED_FIELDS` is active. The seed used for the other
+modes will be `Seed`.
+
 Lightcone output                                     {#lcone}
 ================
 
